  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3092,
      "text": "The people of Lot rejected the messengers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 160,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3093,
      "text": "when their brother Lot said to them, “Will you not fear Allah?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 161,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3094,
      "text": "I am a trustworthy messenger to you,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 162,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3095,
      "text": "so fear Allah, and obey me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 163,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3096,
      "text": "I do not ask you for any reward for this; my reward is only with the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 164,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3097,
      "text": "Do you approach males with lust among all people[20],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 165,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3098,
      "text": "leaving the wives whom your Lord has created for you? You are but a transgressing people.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 166,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3099,
      "text": "They said, “O Lot, If you do not desist, you will surely be expelled.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 167,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3100,
      "text": "Lot said, “I am one of those who utterly abhor your practice.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 168,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3101,
      "text": "My Lord, save me and my family from [the consequences of] what they do.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 169,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3102,
      "text": "So We saved him and all his family,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 170,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3103,
      "text": "except an old woman who was among those who remained behind[21].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 171,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3104,
      "text": "Then We destroyed the rest,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 172,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3105,
      "text": "and We poured down upon them a rain [of stones]. How terrible was the rain of those who were warned!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 173,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3106,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a sign in this, yet most of them would not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 174,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3107,
      "text": "Your Lord is indeed the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 175,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 374,
      "ruku": 324,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3108,
      "text": "The people of the Forest[22] rejected the messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
